  "text": "proprium.dominica-vi-post-epiphaniam-collecta",
  "about": "The collecta of the formulary “Transferred Sixth Sunday after Epiphany” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that, always meditating on what is reasonable, we may accomplish, both in word and in deed, the things that please You. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, forever and ever." },
    "s02": { "translation": "Amen." }
  },
